    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d415-a2">

                <pb facs="1473" n="1315" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1315"/>

                <head>[Subinclosure.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Imperial Russian Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-07"><hi rendition="#italic">January 7,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Messrs. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gartner &amp;
                        Steward</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United Bank Building, Paterson, N.
                        J</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: I have your letter of yesterday’s
                    date relating to the extension of the life of patents granted under the Russian
                    patent law and would advise you to communicate on the subject with the United
                    States ambassador at St. Petersburg, at the same time furnishing him with all
                    necessary information in regard to the specific cases you have in hand, so as to
                    enable him to lay this matter in complete shape before the proper
                    authorities.</p>
                <p>Yours, faithfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rohn.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
